, "publishedAt": "2026-11-13T02:31:00.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "印度10月通胀数据超出预期，加速升至两年高位，市场对加息的担忧升温，可能对Nifty指数的上涨行情构成考验。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Asian Stocks Gain After Nvidia Upheaval, Oil Holds: Markets Wrap", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-12/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates", "excerpt": "Asian stocks climbed as investors eased back into technology shares amid fading concerns that a leadership crisis at Nvidia Corp. may derail the broader artificial-intelligence trade. Oil steadied.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T22:17:13.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Singtel Says ‘Fairly Insulated’ From Nvidia, Raises Guidance", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-13/singtel-raises-profit-outlook-as-overseas-businesses-gain-ground", "excerpt": "Singapore Telecommunications Ltd. said it is largely insulated from developments surrounding Nvidia Corp., with only a small share of its data-center capacity exposed to neocloud customers that may be linked to the chipmaker.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-13T00:45:59.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "新加坡电信上调业绩指引，称受英伟达相关事件影响「相当有限」，仅少量数据中心产能暴露于可能与英伟达有关联的新云客户。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Compass Sues Multiple Listing Services, Upping Antitrust Row", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-12/compass-sues-multiple-listing-services-ramping-up-antitrust-row", "excerpt": "A feud over how consumers can buy and sell homes escalated on Thursday with a slew of antitrust lawsuits filed across the country by the top US broker for residential properties.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T22:48:32.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "New World Suspends Trading as Investors Watch for Next Steps", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-13/new-world-suspends-trading-as-investors-watch-for-next-steps", "excerpt": "New World Development Co. has suspended trading in its shares, as the embattled real estate firm prepares to make an announcement to investors a month after reporting a record annual loss.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-13T00:57:36.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "新世界发展暂停股份交易，公司即将向投资者发布公告。此前一个月，该公司公布了创纪录的年度亏损。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 13", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-12/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-13", "excerpt": "Oil held gains after President Donald Trump said the US could forgo a deal with Iran, dimming prospects for a breakthrough to end the war that has roiled Middle East supplies.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T23:02:09.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "India Equity Surge Brightens Outlook for Exchanges, Brokerages", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-13/india-equity-surge-brightens-outlook-for-exchanges-brokerages", "excerpt": "India’s $5.4 trillion equity market is bouncing back to life, creating a sweet spot for exchanges and brokerages as stronger trading activity brightens their earnings outlook.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "印度规模5.4万亿美元的股市重现活力，交易活动增强，交易所与券商的盈利前景因此改善。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Silver Market Set for Deficit Even as Solar Makers Cut Back", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-13/silver-market-set-for-deficit-even-as-solar-makers-cut-back", "excerpt": "The silver market is set for a sixth straight annual supply deficit in 2026, even as solar manufacturers cut their use of the metal and investor selling eases pressure on the physical market.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-13T00:30:00.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "白银市场预计2026年将连续第六年出现供应短缺，尽管太阳能制造商减少用银量、投资者抛售放缓减轻了实物市场压力。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Australia Bond Yield Falls Below US Peer as Rate Paths Diverge", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-13/australia-bond-yield-falls-below-us-peer-as-rate-paths-diverge", "excerpt": "Australia’s benchmark bond yield fell below its US counterpart for the first time in more than a year as expectations for monetary policy in the two nations diverge.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-13T00:24:14.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "澳大利亚基准国债收益率一年多来首次跌破美国同期国债收益率，因两国货币政策预期分化。"}], "overview": "今日核心事件是英伟达CEO黄仁勋因婚外情丑闻辞职，CFO克雷斯出任临时CEO，事件迅速外溢至美国对华芯片政策与国会审查层面，投资者逢低买入使股价收复大部分跌幅。技术侧，Google密集发布Gemini 4系列模型与Decisions API，将竞争引向「决策模型」；OpenAI Codex生态持续扩张，多家企业披露用其提升交付效率。财经方面，印度通胀超预期引发加息担忧，同时股市回暖利好交易所与券商，黑石入股IIFL；香港新世界发展停牌。时政聚焦美国特使赴俄斡旋乌克兰问题，以及黄仁勋事件引发的对华政策与出口管制争论。", "market": {"market_overview": "美股方面技术面分化：AAPL维持多头排列并接近52周高，SPY与QQQ则回落至SMA20/SMA50下方、RSI14分别为48.5与45.4，整体偏中性整理，NVDA单日-4.34%、RSI26进入超卖。加密方面整体承压明显，加密总市值2.38万亿美元、24小时-6.13%，BTC主导率59.2%、ETH 10.2%，恐慌贪婪指数仅20（极度恐慌），BTC与ETH的RSI14分别降至27.9与27.3、均处超卖，SOL更低至21.5，三大币种MACD均偏空。中概股技术面最弱，BABA单日-7.05%、5日-12.69%，跌破全部主要均线并触发MACD死叉、接近52周低，PDD与腾讯同为空头排列，仅JD勉强站上SMA20、RSI53.5相对中性。商品外汇方面，黄金期货跌破SMA20/50/200且MACD死叉、接近52周低，WTI原油位于SMA20下方、RSI41.7，美元指数则多头排列、RSI64.9接近超买，美元/人民币贴近52周低、空头排列。宏观侧VIX回落至18.7、5日-33.64%，10年期美债收益率5.1%呈多头排列，风险情绪指标与资产走势出现分歧。", "watchlist": [{"symbol": "NVDA", "display_name": "英伟达 (NVDA)", "stance": "偏下行", "rationale": "现价166.19美元，单日下跌4.34%，5日跌幅8.49%，距52周高点回落31.71%。RSI14仅26，已进入超卖区；MACD值-13.2421低于信号线-9.0796，绿柱扩张。价格同时跌破SMA20（201.25）、SMA50（215.96）与SMA200（204.34），均线空头压制明显，动量偏弱。"}, {"symbol": "BTC-USD", "display_name": "比特币 (BTC-USD)", "stance": "偏下行", "rationale": "现价70125.6美元，单日下跌5.19%，5日跌幅7.42%，距52周高点-32.58%。RSI14为27.9，处于超卖区间；MACD值-2215.91显著低于信号线-1661.47，绿柱扩大。价格低于SMA20（77151.65）、SMA50（80833.48）与SMA200（73074.89），叠加加密恐慌贪婪指数仅20的极度恐慌，技术面明显承压。